# Wave T41 (Shingle kit): shellroof — Shingle Town's own roof
# kind. SCALLOPED SHELL SHINGLE: courses of pale sand
# shingles (#d9c491) whose lower edges curve into scallop
# arcs, each course shadowed under its lip, shell-white
# flecks on the faces. A scalloped course is structurally
# unlike Clover's vertical batten boards, Hushmoor's dark
# gravel shingles and the Lab/Mart's flat slate (byte-kept).
# Worn by the House and the town's two facade cottages.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T41-SHINGLE-PLAN.md.)
